<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3655] Fix running a paragraph through the REST API with a restricted access interpreter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3655</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;How to&#160;reproduce bug:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create an access group, add the user to this group;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;In the interpreter, we assign access for this group (we do not register the username on the access);&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run through REST runAll;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;We get an error that the user does not have access to the interpreter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;But we don&apos;t get this error if run in browser.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
